    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T13:07:42Z",
    "body": "Remaining issues:\n- [x] Spec references missing for SVG11, SVGTiny12 and SVG2  (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/572)\n- [x] Fix links to CSP list initialization algorithms  (https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/574)\n- [x] https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/Add-ons/Plugins/Gecko_Plugin_API_Reference redirected to https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Plugins/Guide (https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/591)\n- [ ] https://dvcs.w3.org/hg/editing/raw-file/tip/editing.html redirected to https://w3c.github.io/editing/ but that's a collection of links to other specs. Figure out which of them we should reference. \n\nOther than that it's deliberate redirects like https://whatwg.org/html to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/ and fragments that are handled by JavaScript on caniuse.com and https://w3c.github.io/DOM-Parsing/, none of which we should fix.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
